---

This skill extracts only the AI-reasoning layer (triage severity scoring,
SLA/escalation rules, damage-assessment schema) of
https://github.com/hislordshipprof/opsly — a full production SaaS
application. No source code from that repository was copied. The severity
decision tree, output schema, and prompt structure are an independent
reimplementation of the observed behavior. `scripts/sla.py`'s deadline and
breach-check functions reimplement the short arithmetic algorithm described
in the source's `sla.ts` (add priority-specific hours to a timestamp;
compare against "now") — this is a non-copyrightable functional algorithm,
expressed here in new Python code. The source repository has no declared
license (no LICENSE file at the time of writing).
